{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel is exhausted. Work has drained him. And things only get worse when he\u2019s forced to pull an all-nighter, just after hearing whispers about something unsettling. Office murders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team has to deliver the entire project by morning, and the pressure is crushing. Normal stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>... Uhn?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You want to know about <u><strong>ITO</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Why...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What\u2019s there to know?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape your relationships with the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procrastinate\u2026 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to work and finish your tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects in the scenery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light contextual puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible disappearance.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible homicide.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible serial killer.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to understand why no one seems willing to tell you what is going on...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the office at night. <strong>It\u2019s empty...</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326360?t=1773149690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326360/7b087d3af1fd9d0982a499785854766d48b0ad9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773149690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326360/4fb3446534c00e2fbbbcda8fc2a672cb5a3346a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773149690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326360/4fb3446534c00e2fbbbcda8fc2a672cb5a3346a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773149690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes and references that some players may find disturbing. These include:\r\n\r\nVerbal and physical abuse\r\n\r\nDepression and anxiety\r\n\r\nSuicide\r\n\r\nDescriptions of violent acts\r\n\r\nTorture\r\n\r\nPoisoning\r\n\r\nJumpscares\r\n\r\nPlease note: The game does not feature graphic or explicit depictions of these topics. Instead, they are primarily referenced through dialogue and narrative context to create emotional impact and tension."},"demos":[{"appid":4038260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>April has something to say:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326360/extras/e7e240ef1641f4204b9edf1e297b68a1.avif?t=1773149690\" width=188 height=326 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WISHLIST THE GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-ali