></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible serial killer.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to understand why no one seems willing to tell you what is going on...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the office at night. <strong>It\u2019s empty...</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Po\u00e9tica Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326360/1db5370cdb23c9fbc7162d3d3f3615fc00e822b5/header.jpg?t=1773149690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements are TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements are TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3326360/360549983/77803fde71340d3f3659d6e3681acc952102417e/1760532097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760533670","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3326360/360549983/77803fde71340d3f3659d6e3681acc952102417e/1760532097/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760533670","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3326360/360549983/77803fde71340d3f3659d6e3681acc952102417e/1760532097/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760533670","id":257218290,"name":"NO MORE WORK FOR ITO | Atmosphere Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218290/aeb44d3870